<!--
  students/letters.ejs — Letters activity menu page
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
  Activities: Haystack, Find Pairs, Alphabetical, Write (penmanship),
  Soragaki ABC (external link), Letters & Sounds (SRS).
  Each activity button contains a decorative inline preview.

  AUDIT NOTES:
    • progressPie selectors are manually re-initialized in <script> because
      document.querySelector runs at parse time in progress.js and misses
      these elements. This is a workaround for the bug noted in progress.js.
    • SRS ranks array length (25) assumes 25 letters — but SRS/SRS_abc.js only has
      25 letters too (missing 'x'). Consistent, but both are wrong if 26 is intended.
    • External link to school.bunkei.co.jp has no rel="noopener" — minor.
-->
